VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it together with this aluminum composite panel. I have another episode where I talk specifically about aluminum, my favorite connectors, and other tools and accessories for working with it. But, as an example, our lockers. We have'

[05:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this plastic profile that can be purchased from T- profile suppliers. It is inserted into the groove of the T-shaped profile, and then your three-millimeter'

[06:08] [scene:talk]
