AUDIO: 'composite panel is pressed into it. This is the basis of our cabinets and several walls. Simple, but effective . Self-adhesive tile. We chose a company called Stick on Tiles Australia. We\'ll probably do a'

[06:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'review of the van in about 6 months and tell you how everything held up to the test. I\'m really curious if the adhesive base will withstand the Australian heat. This is a big problem when you use something sticky in a van. Heat is the worst nightmare for many'

[06:32] [scene:talk]
